  description: 'Inflict a stack of Poison. At the start of each of its turns a poisoned
    enemy takes 5 true damage plus 4% (Max 4.8%) of its max HP per stack. Each tick
    can miss: 15% with one stack, +7% for every extra stack. A miss cures the poison
    and removes every stack. Mana cost: 100.'
